  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Explorer Duffle Bag 45 in Signature Canvas works well for travel and weekend plans. Crafted of refined pebble leather and smooth leather, this duffle bag features inside multifunction pockets and a roomy interior for ample storage. A detachable strap allows for comfortable shoulder or crossbody wear, and the side handle makes it easy to carry.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Refined pebble leather and smooth leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Recycled polyester lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside multifunction pockets</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Handle with 4.5&quot; drop Side handle</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable strap with 19.75&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
